# The Times of India

> India's leading English-language news publisher covering breaking news, politics, business, technology, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, education, health, automobiles, defence, science, and global affairs.

Official Website: https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/

The Times of India publishes breaking news, live coverage, analysis, explainers, opinion, photo galleries, videos, special reports, market updates, and consumer-focused information for readers in India and around the world.

